2b:["$","ul","ul-5",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Iron"}],": Your blood volume increases by 50% to support the baby. This dilutes your red blood cells (physiologic anemia).","\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","em","em-0",{"children":"Eat"}],": Steak, liver, lentils, spinach, fortified cereal."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","em","em-0",{"children":"Pairing"}],": Always eat Iron with Vitamin C (oranges, peppers) to increase absorption by 300%."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","em","em-0",{"children":"Avoid"}],": Calcium (dairy) with Iron meals—it blocks absorption."]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Omega-3s (DHA)"}],": Critical for that developing brain. Salmon (low mercury) or algae-based supplements."]}],"\n"]}]
